cmd write_sta_db [-no_compress] filename
cmd read_sta_db filename
write_sta_db [-no_compress] filename 
  The write_sta_db command writes a binary STA database of the current design,
  libraries, SDC, and timing graph. The file is gzip-compressed unless
  -no_compress is given.
  -no_compress  Write an uncompressed database file.
read_sta_db filename 
  The read_sta_db command reads a database written by write_sta_db and restores
  the design, libraries, SDC, and timing graph.
